  "validation": "Temporary native ASan/UBSan and i386 audit instantiates all three runtimes with actual state/text/event helpers and typed observer graph. Checks boundary/fallthrough, retained query strings, disabled/input behavior, slider signed arithmetic, ceil wheel steps, repeat timing, direct versus queued synchronization, and all observer routes including fourteen-message preset updates with no notification feedback. Source-only; no live widget/engine/settings integration.",
  "limits": "Native storage and supplied backend operations replace original class/intrusive/vector/SEH ABI. Widget frame/internal-part creation and layout/color/track geometry/input locking are not reconstructed. Preference reads/writes/apply helpers and sound driver remain typed services, not recovered implementations. Native enabled-empty selector and invalid floating conversion throw instead of dereferencing/converting invalid original state. No additional menu action enabled."
